lane: channel-sentinel-default
why: Channel.apply still returns StmChannel, the slowest lane measured
  (okayStrongChunk 166.1 vs zioStrongChunk 124.0), while the faster
  answer with the SAME contract is already measured at 115.9
  (okayLayeredChunk). Profile of okayStrongChunk: List.reverse 40% of
  leaf samples, the persistent-queue machinery ~75% -- immutable.Queue
  is two lists with an amortized reverse, and in a bulk receive the
  amortization does not hold because the producer refills `in` while
  the consumer drains `out`, so each batch reverses a buffer up to
  1024 deep.
how: SentinelChannel -- the strong contract by CONSTRUCTION, not by an
  in-flight barrier. Termination travels through the ring's own tail
  CAS as a mark, so "accepted" and "ordered" are the same instant.
  A sender decides what to publish AFTER winning its position: if
  close already landed it publishes a void mark and answers false, so
  the TOCTOU that broke ring-channel four times cannot open. Must pass
  BOTH law tiers before Channel.apply moves.
